OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FLacey's mortified in front of
OL,7,     FDylan. David freezes up. Tane asks
OL,8,     FMali a big favour.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FDr Amir Khan removes the biggest
OL,11,     Flipoma he has ever seen from
OL,12,     FNigel's chest. Vanda was told she
OL,13,     Fhad only two years to live, but Dr
OL,14,     FChris Harris offers a more
OL,15,     Fpositive prognosis.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FWojcieches had an epileptic
OL,18,     Fseizure at work. And too little
OL,19,     Frecovery time between seizures
OL,20,     Fcould lead to permanent brain
OL,21,     Fdamage. Thomas has a ring stuck on
OL,22,     Fhis finger.
